<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks at record close on FOMC.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks at record close on FOMC.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks extended earlier gains to reach a record close on Tuesday in the wake of the Federal Open Market Committee decision not to change U.S. base rates, traders and analysts said.</p>
<p>According to preliminary figures, the leading IPC share index .MXX was up 31.68 points, or 0.81 percent, at 3,953.06.</p>
<p>(( --Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
